  "about": "How the night rounds run (one round per night). BO3's zombie health curve: hpStart, +hpLinearPerRound each night until hpLinearUntil, then x hpMultAfter per night (gentler after hpCapRound). HP is in BO3 units; divide by hpScale for Skyrim health. Weapons are tiered against it (weapons sheet): the starting staff falls off around night 8, Coffer weapons around night 20-25, relics later, the Reforge (+60% a level) pushes each further. Skyrim weapons and spells take a share of a zombie's night health per hit (skyrimHitShare).",
